  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Tanaris quests restored from Ascension can be taken, completed and rewarded",
  "contract": "rev_20261101_30_coa_tanaris_restore.sql restores the 16 Tanaris quests the server lacked from the Ascension questcache.wdb captures. Each is taken natively from its giver in chain order, so every PrevQuestID and ExclusiveGroup gate applies, and handed in natively at its ender. Speaking to Zalashji credits A Serpentine Strange 255028; coming within 5 yards of Prospector Ironboot, Importer Sprocketspring and Henry Crabgrass credits each delivery of Nothing to Declare 255037; taking one Contractual Concern removes the other. Battery Salvage 255055 needs a Stormborn Cloud Serpent killed and ends at the Zeppelin Battery, which starts Power From Storms 255056. The Bloodsail Logbook starts The Informant 255040; Arvon, who ends it, attacks a player who takes The Informant - Booty Bay's Ally 255041, and his death completes it for Baron Revilgaz. Importer Sprocketspring sells 16 goods and Henry Crabgrass opens an engineering trainer window. Item objectives are granted as fixtures and the Hazzali kills of 909042 are fixture-completed.",
